		(property "Description" "One physical model board lamp. Value is a free descriptive label (e.g. OS, TRACK, MC) and is not used elsewhere. IndicationToken is a comma-separated list of indication names (track circuits such as 795T1,2NAA,799T1, or tokens such as MC1K) OR'd to drive this one lamp. All listed indications are still individually on the CodeLine wire"
